{"3574140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Cat: Tales of Istanbul", "steam_appid": 3574140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rediscover the world from a new perspective: through the eyes of a cat!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Cat: Tales of Istanbul</i> is a story-driven cat simulation where you experience the world through three very different kittens — a spoiled housecat, a charming stray, and a hardened survivor — each revealing a new side of Istanbul’s soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/3601cfd30fd35de3b22886a542da8e3d.poster.avif?t=1763493235\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/3601cfd30fd35de3b22886a542da8e3d.webm?t=1763493235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Live Three Cat Lives</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every kitten offers its own mood, gameplay, and a new story to uncover:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_R.png?t=1763493235\" /></span> <strong>The White Cat — The Housecat:</strong> Your typical spoiled cat — entitled, adorable, and impossible to ignore. Knock things off tables, scratch furniture, demand affection, and walk away the moment you get it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life is easy, predictable… until it suddenly isn’t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/eb57eaf9140197265e62bd95ec6df547.poster.avif?t=1763493235\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/eb57eaf9140197265e62bd95ec6df547.webm?t=1763493235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_L.png?t=1763493235\" /></span> <strong>The Ginger Cat — The Stray:</strong> The flirty, charming heart of Istanbul — a street celebrity adored by everyone, yet belonging to no one. She strolls through markets, lounges on café chairs, and wins treats with a purr and a tilt of her head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vendors feed her, tourists take her picture, locals call her by name — but no one takes her home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/c3c72624e348863e1d2e995c3f0a1cfd.poster.avif?t=1763493235\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/c3c72624e348863e1d2e995c3f0a1cfd.webm?t=1763493235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_R.png?t=1763493235\" /></span><strong> The Black Cat — The Survivor:</strong> A shadow among the alleys — cautious, silent, and scarred. Life has never offered him safety, only lessons carved into his fur. He digs through garbage for scraps, steals from careless hands, and fights other strays for every mouse and patch of ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He doesn’t trust people. He barely trusts himself. But one day, something will make him question that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/7d96367b6652370d28074b38155833ec.poster.avif?t=1763493235\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/7d96367b6652370d28074b38155833ec.webm?t=1763493235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Like a Real Cat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_L.png?t=1763493235\" /></span> <strong>Walk, climb, sneak, and nap</strong> with natural feline movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_R.png?t=1763493235\" /></span><strong> Meow and purr</strong> to communicate, distract, or charm humans and animals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_L.png?t=1763493235\" /></span><strong> </strong>Use enhanced <strong>feline senses</strong> to reveal scents, sounds, and hidden paths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_R.png?t=1763493235\" /></span><strong> Mark territory</strong> and create checkpoints through scratching or rubbing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/paw_L.png?t=1763493235\" /></span><strong> Push, knock, and carry objects</strong> to solve small environmental puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/057e2d3382816ffe2b78071d5936eb4e.poster.avif?t=1763493235\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/057e2d3382816ffe2b78071d5936eb4e.webm?t=1763493235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Soul of Istanbul</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From sunlit rooftops to rain-soaked alleys, Istanbul is alive with vendors, children, seagulls, and countless tiny stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter intertwines across the same city — familiar places look, sound, and feel new through another cat’s eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/4ea06b952fcc612adbd90449fbffd5f9.poster.avif?t=1763493235\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574140/extras/4ea06b952fcc612adbd90449fbffd5f9.webm?t=1763493235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cozy, Emotional, and Deeply Human</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the cozy fur and playful leaps lies a story about independence, empathy, and belonging — not just for cats, but for anyone searching for home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of <i>Stray</i>, <i>Spiritfarer</i>, <i>Little Kitty, Big City</i>, and <i>Endling</i>, blending cozy life-sim elements, story-rich exploration, a